{"id": "EUVD-2026-103312", "enisaUuid": "ac271ed1-a172-314f-a67a-b7d6710ece55", "description": "phpMyFAQ 4.0.0 before 4.1.9 and 4.2.0-alpha before 4.2.0-beta contains a broken object-level authorization vulnerability in the PUT /api/v3.1/faq/update endpoint, which checks only the global edit_faq permission and does not verify access to the target FAQ. Authenticated users with edit_faq permission can supply the ID of a restricted FAQ they cannot view to modify its content, bypass moderation, and change its publication state.", "datePublished": "2026-10-17T18:46:26", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T21:33:12", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/thorsten/phpMyFAQ/security/advisories/GHSA-j3px-r7cr-r26r", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/phpmyfaq-4.0.0-before-4.1.9-and-4.2.0-alpha-before-4.2.0-beta-bola-in-faq-update-via-rest-api"], "aliases": ["GHSA-cwqc-qp2c-47mg", "CVE-2026-111908"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.29, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "531ad82b-9a39-37a9-a9c8-4a820667d029", "product": {"name": "phpMyFAQ", "vendor": {"name": "thorsten"}}, "product_version": "4.0.0 <4.1.9"}, {"id": "e245d5df-27f9-3364-9801-91f97c3a5259", "product": {"name": "phpMyFAQ", "vendor": {"name": "thorsten"}}, "product_version": "4.2.0-alpha <4.2.0-beta"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "52d62c9d-873b-3411-be85-25d23da4ecc2", "vendor": {"name": "thorsten"}}], "isExploited": false}